      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Based on the results of the clinical and urodynamic investigation of 15 patients, presenting with functional genitourinary symptoms, the authors report the efficacy of treatment with alpha-blockers. They stress the importance of the clinical history and of static sphincterometry in this type of patient."},
